       iibbvv__ccrreeaattee__ccqq(()) creates a completion queue (CQ) with at least  _c_q_e  en‐
       tries for the RDMA device context _c_o_n_t_e_x_t.  The pointer _c_q___c_o_n_t_e_x_t will
